+        A fresh Wan stream starts with one anchor followed by zero or more
+        four-frame transitions (``T = 1 + 4n``).  Every later call consumes
+        complete four-frame transitions (``T = 4n``).  This is the same cache
+        lifetime used by LingBot-VA online inference: reset once per episode,
+        then retain encoder feature caches across observation chunks.
